azp/posix/1
destructive

# The lookup runs inside a forked worker process, which dies on macOS as soon
# as the lookup issues its HTTP request ("A worker was found in a dead state").
# Reproduced on every run, on ansible-core 2.20, 2.22 and devel. This is most
# likely the Objective-C fork safety crash tracked in
# https://github.com/ansible/ansible/issues/49207, which is not something this
# collection can work around.
skip/macos
